<title>UK: Total sets 900 mln French franc 12yr bond.</title>
<headline>Total sets 900 mln French franc 12yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Banque Nationale de Paris.</p>
<p> BORROWER   TOTAL SA</p>
<p> AMT    900 MLN FFR   COUPON     6.20	MATURITY    10.JAN.09</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.134   PAY DATE    10.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.70	REOFFER    99.834    SPREAD	+20 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    PARIS</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) FIVE</p>
<p> NOTES	DOMESTIC BOND</p>
